---
title: CMN — Employee Import Session State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Validating : POST /employee/validate-import\n(file upload)

    Validating : Validating\n(file parsing + row validation)

    Valid : Valid\n(CanImport = true)\nSessionId exists in Redis\nTTL: 30 minutes

    Invalid : Invalid\n(CanImport = false)\nHasFormatError = true\nSessionId exists in Redis\nTTL: 30 minutes

    PartiallyValid : Partially Valid\n(CanImport = true)\nHasDataError = true, HasErrorFile = true\nValid rows will be imported\nError rows skipped

    Imported : Imported\n(execute complete)

    Expired : Expired\n(Redis TTL elapsed)

    Validating --> Valid : All rows pass validation\nCanImport = true\nHasFormatError = false\nHasDataError = false
    Validating --> Invalid : File format errors\nCanImport = false\nHasFormatError = true
    Validating --> PartiallyValid : Some rows have data errors\nCanImport = true\nHasErrorFile = true\nValidRowCount > 0

    Valid --> Imported : POST /employee/import { SessionId }\nRace-condition re-check\nCreate IdentityUser + Employee per row
    PartiallyValid --> Imported : POST /employee/import { SessionId }\nImports valid rows only\nSkips duplicate/error rows

    Valid --> Expired : 30min TTL elapsed\nSession evicted from Redis
    Invalid --> Expired : 30min TTL elapsed
    PartiallyValid --> Expired : 30min TTL elapsed

    Expired --> [*] : ExecuteImportAsync throws\n(session not found in Redis)
    Imported --> [*] : Terminal

    note right of Valid
        Redis key: import_employee_{sessionId}
        Contains: ValidRows[], AllRows[], Errors[]
        SessionId returned to frontend for step 2
    end note

    note right of PartiallyValid
        Error file available at:
        GET /employee/error-file/{sessionId}
        Contains row-level error details (XLSX)
    end note

    note right of Imported
        Student email format:
        {StudentCode}@student.edu.vn
        IsFirstLogin = true for all imported employees
    end note
